| style="background:white;"| White |- ! {{ill|Ninth Purple Fire Star|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|12=draft|12=draft}} | Kyūshi Kasei | Fire | {{ill|South|ja|南|12=draft|12=draft}} | {{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|12=draft|12=draft}} | style="background:purple;color:white;"| Purple |}
Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|ja|太陽系|12=draft|12=draft}}.
