ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gen (Bagua)|lt=Gen|qq=|qq=draft}} | style="background:white;"| White |- ! {{ill|Ninth Purple Fire Star|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=|qq=draft}} | Kyūshi Kasei | Fire | {{ill|South|ja|南|qq=|qq=draft}} | {{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|qq=|qq=draft}} | style="background:purple;color:white;"| Purple |}
Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|ja|太陽系|qq=|qq=draft}}.
