| Earth | Center | {{ill|Taiji (philosophy)|ja|太極|fr|Taiji (philosophie)|ru|Великий предел|ja|太極|lt=Taiji|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Taiji (philosophy)|qq=}} | style="background:yellow;"| Yellow |- ! {{ill|Sixth White Metal Star|1=Sixth White Metal Star|ja|六白金星|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|13=User:Immanuelle/Sixth White Metal Star|qq=}} | Roppaku Kinsei | Metal | Northwest | {{ill|Qian|ja|乾|1=Qian (Bagua)|2=ja|3=乾|lt=Qian (乾)|1=Qian (Bagua)|lt=Qian|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian|13=User:Immanuelle/Qian (Bagua)|qq=}} | style="background:white;"| White |- ! {{ill|Seventh Red Metal Star|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=}} | Shichiseki Kinsei | Metal | {{ill|West|ja|西|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/West|qq=}} | {{ill|Dui|ja|兌|1=Dui (Bagua)|2=ja|3=兌|4=zh-yue|5=兌卦|6=ko|7=태 (괘)|8=fr|9=Duì|10=nl|11=Meer (trigram)|12=pt|13=Duì (I Ching)|14=zh-min-nan|15=Tōe-kòa|lt=Dui (兌)|1=Dui (Bagua)|lt=Dui|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui|13=User:Immanuelle/Dui (Bagua)|qq=}} | style="background:red;color:white;"| Red |- ! {{ill|Eighth White Earth Star|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=}} | Happaku Dosei | Earth | Northeast | {{ill|Gen|ja|艮|1=Gen (Bagua)|lt=Gen|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen|13=User:Immanuelle/Gen (Bagua)|qq=}} | style="background:white;"| White |- ! {{ill|Ninth Purple Fire Star|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=}} | Kyūshi Kasei | Fire | {{ill|South|ja|南|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/South|qq=}} | {{ill|Li|ja|離|1=Li (Bagua)|lt=Li|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Li|13=User:Immanuelle/Li (Bagua)|qq=}} | style="background:purple;color:white;"| Purple |}
Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|ja|太陽系|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=}}.
== Relationships Among the Stars == The relationships among the Nine Stars follow the {{ill|five elements theory|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/five elements theory|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}}:
