These relationships are used for predicting {{ill|astrological compatibility|lt=compatibility|ja|相性|nl|Synastrie|ru|Синастрическая астрология|sq|Sinastria|ja|相性|en|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/astrological compatibility|qq=}}, {{ill|fortune|ja|運勢|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/fortune|qq=}}, and {{ill|auspicious directions|ja|吉方位|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/auspicious directions|qq=}}.

