Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|ja|太陽系|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=}}.

