Despite their names, the Nine Stars are not related to celestial objects like the planets in the {{ill|Solar System|ja|太陽系|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Solar System|qq=}}.

== Relationships Among the Stars ==
The relationships among the Nine Stars follow the {{ill|five elements theory|ja|五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/five elements theory|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/five elements theory|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/five elements theory|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}}:

